{
  "name": "WhatsApp AI Bot: personal chat + group @agent (OpenWA + Ollama)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reply to WhatsApp messages with a local AI agent using OpenWA and Ollama\n\n**Who it's for:** anyone who wants a WhatsApp AI assistant without paying for the Meta Cloud API, and without sending chats to a cloud LLM.\n\n**How it works**\n1. [OpenWA](https://github.com/rmyndharis/OpenWA), a free self-hosted WhatsApp API gateway, posts every incoming message to the webhook.\n2. **Should the bot reply?** passes only two kinds of message: a direct message from the contact you name, or a group message that contains your mention keyword (default `@agent`). Everything else is ignored, so the bot never floods a group.\n3. An AI Agent answers with a local Ollama model and remembers the last 30 messages per chat.\n4. The reply goes back to the same chat through OpenWA's `send-text` endpoint.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Run OpenWA and connect a WhatsApp session (scan the QR code).\n2. Run Ollama and pull a model: `ollama pull llama3.2:3b`.\n3. Fill in **Bot settings**: OpenWA URL, the contact's WhatsApp profile name (`pushName`, not the name saved in your phone), the mention keyword and the system prompt.\n4. Create a **Header Auth** credential: name `X-API-Key`, value = your OpenWA API key. Select it in **Send reply via OpenWA**. Select your Ollama credential in **Ollama chat model**.\n5. In OpenWA \u2192 Webhooks, add this workflow's production webhook URL for the `message.received` event, then activate the workflow.\n\nFull step-by-step guide (Docker, tunnel, webhooks): [abhishekrajpurohit.in](https://abhishekrajpurohit.in/blog/complete-guide-self-hosting-n8n-openwa-whatsapp-api)",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "8b095b9c-9890-4a10-af04-24997d00b4bd",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Receive and filter\nWebhook from OpenWA, your settings, and the reply gate.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "58764b41-3b84-4e3b-a3cf-dc8a1153b2be",
      "name": "Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Generate the reply\nLocal Ollama model with per-chat memory.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "248f5cd2-78bb-49d1-9d71-f6f5bd03bd42",
      "name": "Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Send it back\nPOST to OpenWA send-text.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "54fce74c-c9c1-4fa4-9ea5-9d60eccd77c9",
      "name": "Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wa-webhook",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e27fd98d-e8f1-4485-9a54-832d531a723f",
      "name": "Receive WhatsApp message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        60,
        340
      ],
      "webhookId": "191913a8-511e-4cd0-9418-1db18069c22b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "76da82cf-df57-4552-990b-04e6da77a558",
              "name": "openwaBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://openwa-api:2785",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "6a30d48f-01b3-448b-b675-216446439b81",
              "name": "allowedContactName",
              "value": "YourContactName",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "573736ee-8c63-422c-95c8-862cc30d8bcb",
              "name": "mentionKeyword",
              "value": "@agent",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "33dae449-4f9f-42d1-8470-0b3304af59ba",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "value": "You are a helpful assistant replying on WhatsApp. Keep answers short and direct. Use numbered lists for steps. If you are unsure, say so.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ad52ad92-858d-4057-a6bc-eff3edc183b4",
      "name": "Bot settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "254e0a11-59c1-4855-b343-596d716e7626",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.data.isGroup !== true && $json.body.data.contact?.pushName === $json.allowedContactName }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fc87d657-3596-430c-9a34-09e0b643cf13",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.data.isGroup === true && String($json.body.data.body || '').includes($json.mentionKeyword) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "03b18476-46f0-4245-809b-1c856e1cc7e2",
      "name": "Should the bot reply?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.data.body }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "={{ $json.systemPrompt }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "05816bd5-2b36-400a-a3ad-e16abc6f97ab",
      "name": "AI agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        760,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama3.2:3b",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ea821e70-dd40-49c9-8369-b375b74ba86a",
      "name": "Ollama chat model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        580
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Receive WhatsApp message').item.json.body.data.chatId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 30
      },
      "id": "b74115f2-29b2-4ac1-b722-4e670b95331d",
      "name": "Chat memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        920,
        580
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Bot settings').item.json.openwaBaseUrl }}/api/sessions/{{ $('Receive WhatsApp message').item.json.body.sessionId }}/messages/send-text",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ chatId: $('Receive WhatsApp message').item.json.body.data.chatId, text: $json.output }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3e214463-c8c9-4e22-83b9-3d68d9f7b651",
      "name": "Send reply via OpenWA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        340
      ]
    }
